Corresponding source code
  These programs were built from:
  * Invader 0.55.0, upstream commit 696830ff80af227e84e7237c2ef26eb2301ed110
    (2026-10-03), https://github.com/SnowyMouse/invader
      git clone https://github.com/SnowyMouse/invader.git
      git -C invader checkout 696830ff80af227e84e7237c2ef26eb2301ed110
  * the changes and the build recipe in the halo-64 repository, folder
    tools/n64/invader_lite, https://github.com/JackTulli/halo-64
    (stub headers riat.h, riat.hpp, squish.h and vorbisenc.h, the stub
    source sound_lite_stubs.cpp, the CMake edits that build.sh makes, and
    the MinGW-w64 toolchain file mingw-w64-x86_64.cmake). Rebuild with
      tools/n64/invader_lite/build.sh <invader-source> <build-dir> windows
  What is changed: the Rat In a Tube script compiler, libsquish, libFLAC,
  libvorbis, Qt and SDL2 are not linked. Scenario scripts are not compiled
  (a built scenario has none); DXT compression and Ogg Vorbis / FLAC
  encoding and decoding report an error; only the tools listed above are
  built.

